    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Trigger filter\nRuns when a Learner is created on an Event that has **both** the template name and delay custom fields filled in.\n\nThe filter runs in Administrate and cannot read **Config**, so replace `REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_TEMPLATE_FIELD_KEY` and `REPLACE_WITH_EVENT_DELAY_FIELD_KEY` in the filter expression with the same keys you put in Config.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 420
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -80,
        -320
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "be89e8ae-d51a-48d9-b921-6a38be890e6c",
      "name": "Trigger Filter Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Config\n- `TEMPLATE_FIELD_KEY`: Event field holding the communication template **name**\n- `DELAY_FIELD_KEY`: Event field holding the delay in **minutes**\n- `SCHEDULED_TIME_FIELD_KEY`: Learner field that stores the planned send time (UTC)\n- `EMAIL_SENT_FIELD_KEY`: Learner field set to `true` or `false` after sending\n- `SENDING_ADDRESS_ID`: the ID of an Administrate sending address",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 460
      },
